{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":918062,"duration_api_ms":641832,"num_turns":74,"result":"Story S2 committed and pushed (`c64066f6`). Branch is up to date with origin.\n\n**Summary:**\n\n- `woof/lib/audit_filter.py` — new module: `redact()` with 4 built-in patterns (JWT, AWS key, bearer token, token= values) + `apply_size_cap()` + `filter_audit_output()` façade. Uses `errors=\"ignore\"` so truncated output always re-encodes within `max_bytes` (the critique-blocker fix for multi-byte UTF-8 boundary safety).\n- `woof/bin/woof` — `cmd_dispatch` now loads `AuditConfig` from agents.toml and applies `filter_audit_output` to every `.output` file written (both normal and interrupt paths).\n- `tests/unit/woof/test_audit_filter.py` — 7 unit tests covering O1 (JWT/AWS/bearer redaction), O2 (truncation + raw file, including multibyte boundary), O3 (enabled=False passthrough, custom patterns).\n- `tests/unit/woof/test_dispatch.py` — 2 integration tests: dispatch redacts a JWT in stub output; dispatch enforces the size cap configured in agents.toml with raw file overflow.\n\nAll 9 gate checks passed; 74 tests green; critique blockers resolved before commit.","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"db56d5f4-efde-4fea-a386-d0c94b27711f","total_cost_usd":2.4240511500000004,"usage":{"input_tokens":71,"cache_creation_input_tokens":93933,"cache_read_input_tokens":5118748,"output_tokens":35731,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":93933,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":325,"cache_read_input_tokens":105882,"cache_creation_input_tokens":406,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":406},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-sonnet-4-6":{"inputTokens":71,"outputTokens":35731,"cacheReadInputTokens":5118748,"cacheCr